{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "296df57d-cf92-8385-9f6e-5c3aef68d0e1",
  "created_at": "2026-02-20T12:22:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:19:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:19:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi there! Great, wonderful, I got a live person. I'm trying to reach Harbor Table, the restaurant. I want to make a lunch reservation. Is this them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:19:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah. No, I'm afraid this is the City Clerk's office. At City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:19:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall! Oh, no kidding. Well, I must have dialed wrong. Let me look at what I wrote down here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:19:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. Do you want to read me the number you dialed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:19:50-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. Hang on. Hmm, the screen is, wait, it says airplane mode up at the top. Hold on, that's odd, I'm on the landline, but the cell is right here on the table and I was using it to look up the number. Let me fix that. There. Airplane mode off. Great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Is the phone working now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:20:16-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is! Wonderful. So the thing is, I was dialing off an old list. I've got this scrap of paper with restaurant numbers on it from years ago. Half of them are probably the city, the other half are the dentist. [pause] Honestly, I should just throw it out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:20:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Well, numbers do change over the years. I can't say I know the restaurant's number off the top of my head, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:20:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, no, I wouldn't ask you to. That's not your job! I can look it up on the phone now that it's working."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:20:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be the quickest way. If you search for the restaurant by name, the current listing should come up, and most places have a website with the reservation line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:21:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great idea. I'll do that right now. Harbor Table, Newport. Yep, here it comes. Oh, this number is totally different from mine. Look at that. Totally different!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:21:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then that's probably where the mix-up started. Old numbers can get reassigned, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:21:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Well, I'm sorry to bother you at lunchtime. I hope I didn't pull you away from anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:21:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bother at all. It's a quiet one here. If you ever do need the City Clerk, we handle things like records and licenses, and the main City Hall line can point you the right way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:21:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful, good to know! Records and licenses. I'll keep that in mind, though hopefully not for a while. Okay, I'm going to dial the restaurant now. Hopefully they have a table!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:22:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hope so too. Enjoy your lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:22:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks so much, Owen! Have a great Friday! Bye now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-20T12:22:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
